    {
      "text": "Risk of bias and applicability concerns chart (QUADAS-2) for Xpert MTB/XDR ethionamide-resistance studies (Figure 8), rating Cepheid 2020 and FIND 2020. FIND 2020 is low in all domains; Cepheid 2020 is unclear for patient selection and high for reference standard and flow and timing, with low applicability concerns. Key: red = high, yellow '?' = unclear, green = low.",
